            "Nothing in the synthesis formula validates a disputed observation merely because it has been published. The engine can apply the defined function consistently to bad data. Independent verification, source documentation, and challenge procedures remain institutional duties. That is why the positive reading of a number is only as credible as the evidence chain behind its four component signals."
