            "The most defensible conclusion is modest and operational. The cases show that custodial transition involves more than an announcement of withdrawal or a milestone ceremony. Durable arrangements require offices, resources, procedures, and successor-ready obligations that function beyond the personal authority of signatories. The index offers a structured way to summarise a subset of those conditions, while the primary record and local political judgment remain indispensable."
